REM haunted_browser.duck [SPOOKY/FUNNY] - opens a YouTube search for the
REM "Spooky Scary Skeletons" song in the default browser. Harmless - just opens
REM a web search. Windows (Win+R). mac/Linux: adapt the launcher (see rickroll).
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=spooky+scary+skeletons
